    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n28498" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">mĕlĭōro</span></b>  (no <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>perf.</i>),
				ātum, 1, v. a.
			melior, <i>to make better, to better,
				improve</i> (postclass.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">meliorare proprietatem,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Dig.
					7, 1, 13</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">melioratum praedium,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cod. Just. 5, 71, 16</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Cassiod. Var. 9, 3</span></i>.</div>
